    "event_type": "typhoon",
    "severity_level": "elevated",
    "severity_color": "elevated",
    "title": "INVEST 96S",
    "summary": "wind 27-32 kt · 1006 mb · Medium",
    "started_at": "2026-11-21T00:00:00+00:00",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T00:00:00+00:00",
    "location_text": "10.8S 90.4E",
    "lat": -10.8,
    "lon": 90.4,
    "source_primary": "JTWC-ABIO",
    "source_secondary": "disturbance",
    "status": "active",
    "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=-10.8,90.4",
    "official_link": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=-10.8,90.4",
    "country_code": null,
    "payload": {
      "item_type": "disturbance",
      "source": "jtwc_abio",
      "source_key": "jtwc_abio|south_indian_ocean_area|invest_96s",
      "content_hash": "2c872fe39e63b01f",
      "platform_summary": "10.8S 90.4E | winds 27-32 kt | 1006 mb | MEDIUM",
      "platform_location": "10.8S 90.4E",
      "wind": "27-32 kt",
      "risk_48h": null,
      "risk_7d": null,
      "next_update": null,
      "raw_text": "(1) THE AREA OF CONVECTION (INVEST 96S) PREVIOUSLY LOCATED NEAR \n10.4S 90.2E IS NOW LOCATED NEAR 10.8S 90.4E, APPROXIMATELY 394 NM WEST \nOF COCOS ISLANDS. ANIMATED ENHANCED INFRARED (EIR) SATELLITE DEPICTS \nDEEP CONVECTION DISPLACED BY MODERATE NORTHWESTERLY VERTICAL WIND \nSHEAR TO THE SOUTHERN PORTION OF AN ELONGATED LOW-LEVEL CIRCULATION \nCENTER (LLCC) EVIDENT IN A 200344Z METOP-C ASCAT PASS. ENVIRONMENTAL \nANALYSIS REVEALS A MARGINAL ENVIRONMENT FOR DEVELOPMENT WITH MODERATE \nVERTICAL WIND SHEAR (VWS) OF (10 TO 15 KNOTS), MODERATE TO STRONG \nPOLEWARD UPPER-LEVEL OUTFLOW, AND WARM SEA SURFACE TEMPERATURES (SSTS) \nOF 28 TO 29 C. GLOBAL DETERMINISTIC MODELS DEPICT A CLEARLY DEFINED \nCIRCULATION, THOUGH THE SYSTEM STRUGGLES TO MEET WIND SPEED CRITERIA \nAS IT TRAVERSES SOUTHWARD. ENSEMBLE MODELS DEPICT A SLOW DEVELOPMENT \nTREND OVER THE NEXT 24-36 HOURS. MAXIMUM SUSTAINED SURFACE WINDS ARE \nESTIMATED AT 27 TO 32 KNOTS. MINIMUM SEA LEVEL PRESSURE IS ESTIMATED \nTO BE NEAR 1006 MB. THE POTENTIAL FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF A SIGNIFICANT \nTROPICAL CYCLONE WITHIN THE NEXT 24 HOURS REMAINS MEDIUM.",
      "metadata": {
